# ===== Sistem Operasi =====
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ===== Editor / IDE =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ===== Log & file sementara =====
*.log
*.tmp
error/
tmp/

# ===== Konfigurasi lokal (jangan commit kredensial asli) =====
